 &lt;p&gt;• [Claude Tag] Improved scheduled routines in Slack channels: a routine run can now reply in an existing thread instead of always posting a new top-level channel message&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;• [Claude Tag] Improved the timestamp on Claude's live progress checklists to show each reader's local time and how long ago it was updated, instead of a fixed UTC time&lt;/p&gt;</content>
